# A foldable iPhone, posed the way Xcode's device window poses it: the hinge swings and the app moves to the wide
# inner screen when it opens and back to the cover when it closes; the phone turns as a whole, flipped included;
# `posture swap` changes the lit screen at once without moving the hinge.
open!
wait id=title 60
rotate 0
posture closed
expect text="portrait"
rotate 90
expect text="landscape"
rotate 180
rotate 0
expect text="portrait"
posture half
expect text="landscape"
expect id=title
posture open
expect text="landscape"
rotate 90
expect text="portrait"
rotate 0
posture closed slow
expect text="portrait"
posture swap
expect text="landscape"
posture swap
expect text="portrait"
